OL,3,CJames McClean leaves Brandywell as
OL,4,Ccontract terminated
OL,6,FJames McClean has left Derry City
OL,7,FFootball Club after it was mutally
OL,8,Fagreed to terminate his contract with
OL,9,Fimmediate effect.
OL,11,FSpeaking to UTV last week, the
OL,12,Fmidfielder described a contract
OL,13,Fdispute with the club as "a struggle"
OL,14,Fwhich made him feel angry and
OL,15,Ffrustrated.
