OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793202518
OL,3,CJames McClean leaves Brandywell as
OL,4,Ccontract terminated
OL,6,FThe contract decision was announced in
OL,7,Fa statement on Wednesday. which said
OL,8,Fboth the club and McClean were
OL,9,F"satisfied with the outcome" and
OL,10,F"pleased to move forward
OL,11,Fconstructively".
OL,13,FMcClean said: "I am pleased that we
OL,14,Fhave reached a resolution to settle
OL,15,Fthese matters.
OL,17,F"While my return to the Club did not
OL,18,Fwork out as I had hoped, Derry City FC
OL,19,Fwill always hold a special place in my
OL,20,Fheart.
OL,26,@uD@OOU
