PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F302A1793202518
OL,3,CJames McClean leaves Brandywell as
OL,4,Ccontract terminated
OL,6,F"I want to thank the fans for their
OL,7,Fsupport, and I wish the squad, the
OL,8,Fmanagement, staff, and the supporters
OL,9,Fthe very best for the future," he
OL,10,Fadded.
OL,12,F"In particular, I want to wish the
OL,13,Fteam the best of luck in the FAI Cup
OL,14,FFinal against Waterford FC."
OL,16,FChairman of Derry City, Philip
OL,17,FO'Doherty thanked McClean for "his
OL,18,Fdedication to his hometown club" and
OL,19,Fwished him "the very best" for the
OL,20,Ffuture.
