OL,3,CJames McClean leaves Brandywell as
OL,4,Ccontract terminated
OL,6,F"His achievements extend far beyond
OL,7,Fthe Brandywell; amassing 103 senior
OL,8,Fcaps for the Republic of Ireland is a
OL,9,Fremarkable milestone, and we want to
OL,10,Fformally acknowledge his immense
OL,11,Fcontribution to Irish football as a
OL,12,Fwhole."
